WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.995
Use Comments to leave an internal message about a specific ticket.

00:00:03.995 --> 00:00:09.565
Read the existing discussion first, so your message adds information instead of repeating the report.

00:00:09.565 --> 00:00:12.355
Write the update in the comment box and post it.

00:00:12.355 --> 00:00:15.005
Check the author and the new entry in the thread.

00:00:15.005 --> 00:00:17.425
Posting a comment does not resolve the ticket.
